  "idea": "Krita: free open-source digital painting and graphics tool",
  "text": "The best free alternative to Adobe software for creative digital work. Monthly design subscriptions drain your freelance profits while adding little real value to your routine graphic projects. Most free drawing tools lack stylus pressure curves and break layered Photoshop files sent by clients. Krita natively opens PSD files, supports graphic tablet pressure with brush stabilization, and exports print-ready CMYK files. Deliver studio-grade client assets with zero software overhead.",
